# Magnetic Snuffler: "When this creature enters, return target Equipment card from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to this creature.
# Whenever you sacrifice an artifact, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Bot2 destroys Bot1's Thinking Cap (Equipment, +1/+2) on turn 2. On turn 3
# Bot1 casts the 4/4 off five Moxen: the Cap comes back attached (5/6, in no graveyard) and a Black Lotus sacrificed for its mana adds a counter (6/7).

